* pa-a3-twostage: two-stage driver + PA cascade with tuned interstage.
* Lineage: textbook two-stage (driver + output stage) linear PA with an
* inter-stage matching network (Cripps / standard multistage PA lineage).
* Bench-v1 anchor for the higher-gain / higher-Pout tiers. Structure-only,
* ZERO component values.
* Structure: driver CS NM1 (RF choke L1 to VDD); tuned interstage match
* (series L2 + DC-block C2 + shunt-C C3) into the PA-stage CS NM2 gate; PA
* CS NM2 (RF choke L3 to VDD); output L-match (series L4 + shunt-C C5) to a
* DC-blocked VOUT1 (C6). Input DC-blocked (C1). Published in-topology BIAS
* NETWORK: one current-mirror reference (R1 -> diode NM3) biases BOTH gates
* through series feed resistors (R2 -> NM1 gate, R3 -> NM2 gate).
* Approved 2026-09-14 (bench round 1, "approve all").
C C1 VIN1 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 VSS VSS
L L1 VDD n2
L L2 n2 n3
C C2 n3 n4
C C3 n4 VSS
NMOS NM2 n5 n4 VSS VSS
L L3 VDD n5
L L4 n5 n6
C C5 n6 VSS
C C6 n6 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n7
NMOS NM3 n7 n7 VSS VSS
R R2 n7 n1
R R3 n7 n4
